<footer class="footer">
    <section class="box">
        <div class="inner">
            <div class="message">
                <div class="image">
                    <img
                        src="/images/profile.png"
                        alt="Profile picture of Manaj"
                    />
                </div>

                <div class="text">
                    <p>
                        I’ve always been interested in the space between people,
                        technology, and design. I’m curious about bringing
                        digital and physical experiences together, exploring new
                        possibilities with AI, and finding new ways to make
                        things better. After all these years, I’m still amazed
                        by what technology can make possible. Thanks for
                        stopping by! If you’d like to talk about a job, a
                        project, or just an idea, I’d love to hear from you.
                        <br />
                        Feel free to reach out through any of the links below, or
                        download my CV to learn more about my background.
                    </p>
                    <div class="contact">
                        <h5>Contact</h5>
                        <ul class="social no-list">
                            <li>
                                <a
                                    class="fancy"
                                    href="https://www.instagram.com/m.chakrt/"
                                    ><i class="fa fa-solid fa-instagram"></i></a
                                >
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <a
                                    class="fancy"
                                    href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/manaj"
                                    ><i class="fa fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a
                                >
                            </li>

                            <li>
                                <a
                                    class="fancy"
                                    href="mailto:manaj(at)chakrt(dot)com"
                                    ><i class="fa fa-solid fa-envelope-o"
                                    ></i></a
                                >
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="letstalk">
                <h4>Let’s work together!</h4>
                <a
                    href="/images/cv/Manaj-CV.pdf"
                    class="download_cv button"
                    download="Manaj-CV.pdf"
